Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.09,0:00:19.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There. Your wish is granted.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.72,0:00:20.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.81,0:00:21.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.60,0:00:25.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Aren't you supposed to grant\Nthree wishes?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.31,0:00:29.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's just a bonus for regulars.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.69,0:00:33.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Unknown first-timers only get one wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.70,0:00:35.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.32,0:00:37.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.26,0:00:53.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's bright again!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.89,0:01:03.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ow, ow, ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.48,0:01:05.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Owie, ow, ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.73,0:01:09.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-What the heck...?\N-Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.32,0:01:12.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You two! You've grown small!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.94,0:01:15.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?! What're you talkin' about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.95,0:01:17.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.20,0:01:19.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Whoa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.83,0:01:23.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,W-What the heck is this?! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.00,0:01:33.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Whaaaa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.76,0:01:44.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Original Work, Story & Character Design\NAkira Toriyama (Shueisha "Jump comics”)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.48,0:01:50.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Hee, hee hee!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.19,0:01:54.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Time to adventure!\NYou'll be hooked for sure!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.24,0:01:59.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The Demon Realm is full of mystery{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.45,0:02:02.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}DAIMA wonderland{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.49,0:02:05.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Whoopsie daisy!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.29,0:02:09.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Even when your heart shrinks\NAnd you feel low{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.79,0:02:14.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Dreams are everywhere\NDon't worry about it{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.50,0:02:17.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Never give up{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.80,0:02:24.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Here comes a New Story{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.02,0:02:29.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Thousands of jabs and silly jokes{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.27,0:02:32.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}They're waitin' for you{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.11,0:02:39.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Jaan! Jaka jaan!\NThe fanfare of courage{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.61,0:02:47.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}No-holds-barred battles\NThe excitement ain't stoppin'{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.70,0:02:54.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Hey Shenron, grant my wish{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.92,0:03:01.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I wanna meet\NSomeone amazin' again tomorrow{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.93,0:03:06.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Blast it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.06,0:03:11.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If I knew this would happen,\NI would've wished for the Evil Third Eye!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.94,0:03:17.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Neva! Can't you gather\Nthe Demon Realm Dragon Balls like that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.61,0:03:22.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Then you'd have to fight\Nthe Tamagamis and win.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.62,0:03:28.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then can't you do that ritual\Nover again here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.70,0:03:32.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even I can't do that twice in a row.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.54,0:03:38.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well... You got what you wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.21,0:03:42.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It looks like they've pretty much\Nbeen rendered harmless...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.01,0:03:52.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Without this one, the Dragon Balls\Nof this world will be useless, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.27,0:03:57.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Pretty much.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.03,0:04:01.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's bring him with us just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.28,0:04:05.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We can always use him as a hostage\Nif need be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.91,0:04:07.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Understood, sire.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.93,0:04:28.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's goin' on?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.52,0:04:37.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh my gosh!\NTrunks has been turned into a baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.02,0:04:39.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Goten, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.94,0:04:42.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've shrunk, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.11,0:04:46.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Trunks, you've turned into a baby.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.20,0:04:48.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}You're a baby, too.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.03,0:04:51.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Why is this happening?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.66,0:04:53.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I don't know!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.72,0:05:06.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Has everyone shrunk?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.47,0:05:10.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No. The staff are all unchanged!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.56,0:05:14.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who... are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.48,0:05:16.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Mister Satan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.98,0:05:17.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Buu!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.10,0:05:21.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My goodness! I've grown young!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.82,0:05:24.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Look. Isn't our skin so smooth?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.15,0:05:26.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.32,0:05:33.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone looks younger, but I guess\Nthey're the same on the inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.04,0:05:37.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We haven't so much grown young\Nas become tiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.17,0:05:41.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You've always been tiny!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.59,0:05:44.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,As if I didn't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.05,0:05:49.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Whoa! Even Vegeta's all cute now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.39,0:05:52.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.31,0:05:56.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It must have something to do with\NShenron being summoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.48,0:05:59.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fear not, children!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.19,0:06:02.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I, the world's ultra super hero,\NMister Satan will...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.86,0:06:06.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I sensed an unpleasant presence\Nat the temple.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.53,0:06:08.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay! I'll go check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.86,0:06:10.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.20,0:06:17.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hot! Hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.88,0:06:24.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Because you shrank so suddenly, you aren't\Nused to the balance of your body yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.67,0:06:26.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.84,0:06:29.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Master Roshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.93,0:06:32.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're Old Kamesennin!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.76,0:06:38.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I guess I don't look so old anymore, do I?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.77,0:06:44.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can call me Big Kamesennin instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.11,0:06:51.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kibito will take us to the temple.\NCome with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.99,0:06:54.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold it. I'm coming, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.75,0:07:04.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh. Hi there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.96,0:07:06.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This ain't the time for "Hi there."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.26,0:07:10.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Wait, where's Dende?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.51,0:07:13.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Some strange men took him away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.43,0:07:17.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What strange men?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.27,0:07:22.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They had pointy ears and said\Nthey came from the Demon Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.90,0:07:24.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The Demon Realm?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.73,0:07:28.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The Demon Realm?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.70,0:07:35.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.54,0:07:43.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,One of them looked like you,\NSupreme Kai-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.67,0:07:45.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What did you say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.42,0:07:48.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They called him "Degesu."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.76,0:07:50.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Degesu...!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.59,0:07:52.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So it was Degesu.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.34,0:07:53.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Someone you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.76,0:07:56.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's Supreme Kai-sama's younger brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.72,0:07:59.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You've got a brother?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.60,0:08:01.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.73,0:08:04.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And there was a short arrogant guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.73,0:08:07.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,and an old Namek called Neva.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.23,0:08:08.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did you say "Neva"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.57,0:08:10.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.61,0:08:16.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Long ago, he was the Legendary Namek\Nwho remained in the Demon Realm alone
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.53,0:08:18.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,to protect the Demon Realm Dragon Balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.25,0:08:24.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So that Namek controlled\Nthe Earth Dragon Balls?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.62,0:08:28.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He was feeble, but he had great power.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.30,0:08:35.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And the short arrogant guy asked Shenron\Nto turn all of us into children.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.39,0:08:37.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then let's go after them!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.89,0:08:40.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We gotta save Dende!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.47,0:08:44.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We can't. There's no way\Nto teleport to the Demon Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.60,0:08:47.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.36,0:08:53.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We might have something we can use.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.95,0:08:58.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kibito, return to the Supreme Kai World\Nand bring back the spaceship.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.74,0:09:00.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.79,0:09:09.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.50,0:09:11.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I have returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.01,0:09:16.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Long ago, I came to this universe\Nin this spaceship.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.89,0:09:21.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know if it still works.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.98,0:09:31.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.15,0:09:33.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It looks like it won't turn on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.15,0:09:37.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've neglected it for so long, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.03,0:09:41.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,In that case, we can get Bulma to fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.33,0:09:43.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's a genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.66,0:09:45.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go get her!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.17,0:09:57.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Phew! That was close!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.72,0:10:02.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Get used to the balance of\Nyour smaller body.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.76,0:10:04.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you used to yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.32,0:10:14.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like you're the same, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.54,0:10:24.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've brought them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.91,0:10:27.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Vegeta! You're here, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.66,0:10:28.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.62,0:10:32.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't let anyone get away with\Nturning me into a brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.34,0:10:34.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Where's baby Trunks?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.51,0:10:38.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I left him with a babysitter so he's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.18,0:10:40.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I heard what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.09,0:10:43.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So this is the spaceship?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.76,0:10:45.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.72,0:10:47.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This thing is practically junk.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.93,0:10:50.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And it looks like\Nit's been beaten up recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.69,0:10:55.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}That happened when Goku and Vegeta fought\NMajin Buu in the Supreme Kai world.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.69,0:10:58.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This spaceship...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.45,0:11:02.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It has a pretty interesting structure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.20,0:11:06.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A normal spaceship wouldn't be able to\Nget to the Demon Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.79,0:11:09.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll fix it,\Nbut it'll take about ten days.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.91,0:11:11.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That long?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.83,0:11:14.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We need to hurry or they'll kill Dende!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.71,0:11:16.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We don't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.50,0:11:19.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I believe Dende-san will be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.34,0:11:23.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They kidnapped him without killing him,\Nso they must have plans for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.72,0:11:25.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.93,0:11:31.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll need a garage, machines,\Nand helper robots.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.27,0:11:35.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll bring them as capsules, so\Ncould you take me back home, Kibito-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.94,0:11:40.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I... understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.28,0:11:44.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,TWO DAYS LATER
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.62,0:11:51.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How can we return to normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.88,0:12:03.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I think I got the hang of flyin' now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.43,0:12:05.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sure. Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.39,0:12:14.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What the heck? I couldn't reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.49,0:12:23.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.86,0:12:28.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Still can't. Turnin' small\Nmade my sense of distance all screwy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.92,0:12:36.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Be quiet, Kakarot!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.34,0:12:38.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.76,0:12:44.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,At this rate it'll take too long\Nto get used to this size.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.43,0:12:47.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.35,0:12:51.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I gotta go somewhere! I'll be right back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.14,0:12:55.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tch. He's so obnoxious.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.11,0:13:01.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So is everyone with pointy ears\Nfrom the Demon Realm?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.65,0:13:04.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Not everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.28,0:13:08.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But you can assume that most are.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.45,0:13:13.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Long ago, some sought freedom,\Nsome went out to rule other planets...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.04,0:13:15.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Traveling became a thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.46,0:13:19.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,and there was time when many Majin\Nslipped out of the Demon Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.84,0:13:22.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eventually it was forbidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.59,0:13:24.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And now...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.01,0:13:29.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,only those who are granted permission\Ncan travel to and from the Demon Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.06,0:13:37.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.52,0:13:40.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-Hey, Kibito-san.\N-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.73,0:13:45.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I ordered takeout for dinner,\Nso could you teleport and go get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.90,0:13:46.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.78,0:13:51.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.12,0:13:54.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.83,0:13:57.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah. There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.75,0:13:59.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Karin-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.67,0:14:01.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's been a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.00,0:14:05.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You ain't surprised I've shrunk at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.21,0:14:07.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's no need to explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.88,0:14:12.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I sometimes look at\Nthe Surface World below from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.43,0:14:14.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh. You've got a lotta free time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.06,0:14:16.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Pretty much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.31,0:14:20.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,More importantly, Karin-sama,\NI'm here for my Nyoibo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.77,0:14:21.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.07,0:14:25.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,See? It's not in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.19,0:14:28.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}It was here, remember?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.40,0:14:34.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nobody really uses it\Nto go to the Palace anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.33,0:14:35.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.87,0:14:39.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm... Where was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.38,0:14:45.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, that's right.\NI had Master Roshi hold onto it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.01,0:14:47.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,With Master Roshi, huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.80,0:14:49.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.30,0:14:53.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe you should take your Flying Nimbus!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.43,0:14:55.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.35,0:15:01.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's always in such a rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.82,0:15:09.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.41,0:15:13.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah. Goku.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.78,0:15:16.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What're you doin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.66,0:15:22.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now that I'm young again,\Nthere's a lot of things I want to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.13,0:15:23.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.21,0:15:25.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So, how can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.88,0:15:31.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Know where my Nyoibo is?\NKarin-sama said you have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.30,0:15:33.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your Nyoibo?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.10,0:15:36.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm. Did I have it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.56,0:15:41.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What? He said that it was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.94,0:15:44.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did you put it away somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.06,0:15:46.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't recall.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.65,0:15:50.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't be like that.\NYou gotta remember, Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.49,0:15:54.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.74,0:15:57.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome back, Son-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.54,0:16:00.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Lemme show you somethin' cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.37,0:16:03.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ta-daa!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.22,0:16:15.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Extend!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.10,0:16:22.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Return!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.73,0:16:25.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.36,0:16:27.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's your Nyoibo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.07,0:16:29.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Remember it, Bulma?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.11,0:16:32.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Where did you find it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.86,0:16:34.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Master Roshi used it for laundry.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.62,0:16:40.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh! Looks delish!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.00,0:16:42.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Everybody dig in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.37,0:16:44.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.59,0:16:53.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now that I think about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.26,0:16:57.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,it would have been easier\Nif Kibito-san brought the spaceship
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.14,0:16:58.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,back to Capsule Corporation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.06,0:17:04.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I think you're mistaking me\Nfor some kind of delivery boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.52,0:17:07.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Piccolo. Do you remember\Nthe Demon Realm at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.27,0:17:11.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No. I wasn't born back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.98,0:17:14.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I've heard about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.45,0:17:16.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What sort of place is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.53,0:17:20.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The place where Nameks lived\Nwas nice, apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.58,0:17:24.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh. Then why did they escape?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.41,0:17:29.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nameks don't like to be ruled.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.59,0:17:31.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.47,0:17:35.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.80,0:17:39.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,An enemy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.72,0:17:42.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know.\NI don't sense any strong malice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.89,0:17:47.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But my senses may have dulled\Nfrom becoming a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.60,0:17:49.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And after I got a feast for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.06,0:17:51.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here it comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.91,0:18:05.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh! That's the spaceship!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.58,0:18:09.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The one the Demon Realm folks used!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.13,0:18:09.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.09,0:18:13.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh. But it's a different color.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.17,0:18:16.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It could still be one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.44,0:18:35.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.82,0:18:44.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.87,0:18:46.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I am Glorio.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.62,0:18:51.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're from the Demon Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.42,0:18:53.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.63,0:18:58.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're... Goku, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.93,0:19:01.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.60,0:19:03.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I have a request.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.64,0:19:09.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come with me to the Demon Realm\Nand defeat King Gomah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.10,0:19:11.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.56,0:19:13.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?! Gomah?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.77,0:19:17.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who the heck's that King whatever?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.11,0:19:22.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,An evil Majin who became king\Nafter Supreme Demon King Dabura's death.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.53,0:19:24.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now it makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.70,0:19:29.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The short arrogant man\Nwho kidnapped Dende-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.33,0:19:31.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}It was Gomah.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.29,0:19:33.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.13,0:19:35.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A Majin who cannot be underestimated.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.75,0:19:40.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's very powerful, but also very crafty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.05,0:19:42.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.30,0:19:45.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well then, that's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.26,0:19:48.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go. Let's go rescue Dende.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.40,0:19:57.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait a minute!\NHow did you know about Goku-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.94,0:20:00.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I heard from the king of\Nthe Third Demon World.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.65,0:20:04.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He watched your battle with Majin Buu\Nthrough a Magic Monitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.45,0:20:08.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I was ordered by the king to come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.99,0:20:12.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So you serve the king of\Nthe Third Demon World?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.46,0:20:19.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No. I was given the request in secret\Nto come get you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.92,0:20:21.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.63,0:20:25.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Very well. Then I shall go with you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.76,0:20:26.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.18,0:20:28.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You, Supreme Kai-sama?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.85,0:20:33.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It appears that\Nmy brother is involved as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.48,0:20:37.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And I do possess some knowledge\Nabout the Demon Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.36,0:20:39.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.82,0:20:41.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.70,0:20:44.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can I examine your spaceship?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.70,0:20:48.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'd like to use it as reference\Nfor our repairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.95,0:20:50.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Spaceship?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.83,0:20:54.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, you mean my plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.62,0:20:56.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If it goes to space then it's a spaceship.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.59,0:21:00.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It just happened to fly\Nthrough space this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.71,0:21:02.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It doesn't normally.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.13,0:21:02.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.55,0:21:05.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're free to do so, but please hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.56,0:21:11.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That Glorio fellow...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.93,0:21:14.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't let your guard down to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.89,0:21:16.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? How come?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.94,0:21:20.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He shouldn't have known\Nthat we were turned into children,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.03,0:21:22.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,but he wasn't surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.94,0:21:26.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe he heard about it\Nfrom that king of his.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.99,0:21:29.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's hope that's the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.87,0:21:31.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.24,0:21:35.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks. It's impressive,\Nbut I think I understand how it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.12,0:21:39.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I should complete my repairs\Nsooner than expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.04,0:21:40.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.00,0:21:42.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now let's get goin'!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.47,0:21:45.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.09,0:21:50.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Until we deal with that king\Nand restore our Dragon Balls,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.81,0:21:52.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,we'll be children forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.47,0:21:56.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can't.\NThis plane only carries three people.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.48,0:22:02.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?! We're child-sized,\Nso one more can squeeze in!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.57,0:22:04.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.44,0:22:08.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can join us after Bulma-san finishes\Nrepairing the spaceship.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.82,0:22:10.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tch...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.58,0:22:23.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Catch you all later then!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.69,0:22:43.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Holding out my hand{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.36,0:22:47.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Up to the sky{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.15,0:22:51.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The moment is ours{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.32,0:22:55.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Make a miracle happen{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.83,0:23:01.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Like a bird with open wings we fly{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.08,0:23:05.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Picking up{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.92,0:23:09.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Those pieces of hope{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.26,0:23:16.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}There's no giving up{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.77,0:23:20.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Go as far as we can{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.10,0:23:24.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I got you by my side{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.73,0:23:27.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Run, run, run{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.82,0:23:31.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Over the mountain we go{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.41,0:23:35.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I hear it always\NYour voice in my heart{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.24,0:23:39.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}"You know that we're never alone" {\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.62,0:23:45.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,DAIMA
